{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1f09ed9ca10685caaf37b40438aaca5890c5075fa73e450dd799ef83a253a60a", "ja": "（茜プロデュースの洋服が、ついに完成した！\nどんどん茜が工程を進めるので、見守っていたが……）", "zh": "（茜设计的服装终于完成了！茜一直不断推进制作流程，我就在旁边看着，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "2ddfb3585dbb24e45824a8343bc4d1691b44a6749c044169b2cc5d3059fc9258", "ja": "とうとう完成したね……。茜ちゃんの、\n茜ちゃんによる、茜ちゃんのための一着。", "zh": "终于完成了呢……这是属于小茜、由小茜制作、为小茜准备的一套衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "a4d80bb49e98b57127bec58c9e3c2d1b21d4bf6706e6a0d0d2cf566014f5e027", "ja": "どう、{$P$}ちゃん！\nこの姿を前に、カワイイ以外の感想はないでしょ！？", "zh": "怎么样，{$P$}！\n面对这副模样，除了可爱以外，你肯定没有别的感想了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1e9956a15bf0f72f794ef3949792501994b47706ef386e8cd8f5574def095d34", "ja": "うん。よく似合っていて、可愛いと思うよ。\n茜のための一着……まさにその通りだな！", "zh": "嗯。很适合你，我觉得很可爱哦。\n茜专属的一套服装……确实正如你所说呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "6ef5556ae47a21cbd15929bacd853ba90105d4320ecca22f04fa34de3daffc32", "ja": "ニャハハ☆　いやー、こんなカワイイ服に\n仕上がっちゃうなんて、自分の才能が怖すぎる……！", "zh": "喵哈哈☆　哎呀——居然能做出这么可爱的衣服，我都要被自己的才能吓到了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "13bc0d11dc80de1846c31fbae5c9e10a48731d4f619c5d5311c4f680244436c0", "ja": "しかーし！　ここで満足するには、まだ早い！\n次はこの服を、どう広めるか考えないとね！", "zh": "不过！现在就满足还为时过早！\n接下来还得想想，该怎么推广这件衣服才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0056af7d7761a870e550b492630d66a6f009f70eb1e9c0cc2116ef699bbdbf30", "ja": "まさか、そこまで考えているとは……。\nもしかして、何かいいアイディアでもあるのか？", "zh": "没想到，你居然考虑得这么长远……\n难道说，你已经有什么好点子了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "1106a2520e3012f1974ddea6e029123b72aae0c7c25baad0f6cac0286d897c44", "ja": "うーん、それがまだなんだよね～……。\nいや、アイディア自体は思いつくんだよ？", "zh": "嗯——这个嘛，还没有啦～……\n不，我还是能想到一些点子的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "23fdbe641d4c8118d0fc37ec8b01725eca33c25b1119411823e4206280ac7f77", "ja": "例えば、この服を着せたNew茜ちゃん人形を\n作るとか。絶対、話題になる！と思うんだけど……。", "zh": "比如，制作一个给New小茜人形穿上这套服装的玩偶。绝对会成为话题！我是这么觉得的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "d6ff4004a88d4c967ec1cefdba9bcf23f737d9d1a20570e486e1a515584c9b97", "ja": "いつも通りなんだよにゃ～……。どうせなら、みんなの\n期待を超えたいじゃん？　満を持して感欲しいじゃん！", "zh": "还是和往常一样喵～……既然这样，不如超越大家的期待嘛？想要那种蓄势待发的感觉嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3f0155365f3ce15bbb2b07c57f407b4a7c701287a3381809d475b54013c7c003", "ja": "な、なるほど……。\n茜は一歩上のアイディアを求めているんだな。", "zh": "原、原来如此……。\n茜是想要更上一层楼的点子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "e69596594d2ddf9a0c79c8cbeec2052033d1c00ee49e6ff4777c880f8846b8a7", "ja": "そう！　てことで、{$P$}ちゃん。\n茜ちゃんをうならせる提案、ひとつよろしく！", "zh": "对！所以说，{$P$}，拜托拿出一个能让小茜都拍案叫绝的提案来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2622f3a886451f7bc2e3e290c64dfc927c5d040842a860bc76e481d8799c099f", "ja": "軽く言ってくれるなぁ……。うーん……\n派手なことはせずに、シンプルでいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "别说得这么轻松啊……嗯……别搞得太花哨，简单点不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4afa84307b16078e45afd1f3bb17c97f53f7060aa8fb602ad5a724cb2925932c", "ja": "写真をSNSに上げたり、その服のこだわりを\n動画で説明したり……それで十分だと思うけどな。", "zh": "把照片发到社交平台上，再用视频介绍一下对服装的讲究……我觉得这样就够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "8cc1c3d0c076a7df5be1685f7930a58cba9e1ae0b80f3a12bbbd31d4695c8419", "ja": "ええっ！？　{$P$}ちゃん、\n考えるの面倒になってない？", "zh": "诶！？{$P$}，你是不是懒得想了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1015_p", "source_sha256": "78f67026a8dee9fb84f527acfe302368ba1e5b60b1fbd812241176425af305d0", "ja": "ははっ、そうじゃないよ。その服を着た茜がいれば、\n十分だと思ったんだ。ほら、その服のコンセプトは？", "zh": "哈哈，不是那样。我觉得有穿着那身衣服的茜在，就足够了。对了，那身衣服的主题是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "ddba94840432b53811fd9ca3c555c071d1b6262a577a32e4a550829b55a8304f", "ja": "うにゃ？　『いつでもKAWAII茜ちゃん♪』？", "zh": "呜喵？　“随时随地都KAWAII小茜♪”？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e0b5097157d3c274a6b3648852a9d2a19f24b2605711b1d1542f2e416142dbc6", "ja": "ああ。見ただけで茜のことが思い浮かぶくらい\n茜らしさが、たくさん詰まった洋服だ。", "zh": "啊。这件衣服充满了茜的风格，\n让人一看就会想起茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1018_p", "source_sha256": "627ce3e210e2386419b88462e669e37425a88bdbd4ce2918d44edbdc59089ea8", "ja": "持ち味を活かす方向で考えるのが一番だと思うんだ。\nそれに、何事もやり過ぎはよくないしな。", "zh": "我觉得，朝着发挥自身特色的方向考虑是最好的。\n而且，做什么事都不能过头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "b59519e776d2f999cbc504e36628da6f12f0b623240450ac6c96c9aa4b4afddd", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……。そうだね、\n確かに{$P$}ちゃんの言う通りだよ！", "zh": "{$P$}……。对啊，确实正如{$P$}所说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "d5b229e4bf599733ad7323513b894b88f0a535376a1aa5dcf4596020942ca3dd", "ja": "今の茜ちゃんは圧倒的にカワイすぎる……。\nその時点で、もう……「超え」ちゃってるんだね！", "zh": "现在的小茜实在是可爱得犯规……。光是这一点，就已经……“超越”了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "e51e164a7302f9081c0cdf897a7b5489664b84c7bd998da07037fc8ab5c24cd7", "ja": "よーし、そうと決まれば撮影の準備だー！　どんな\nシチュエーションにもハマるって表現したいから……。", "zh": "好～嘞，既然决定了，那就准备拍摄吧——！因为想要表现出自己能融入任何情境嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0624_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "3e883f3e4f04c9a6519b0897b6ce76576169681a45f1946bbbd00e9b0edc9438", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}ちゃんはカメラマンね！\n茜ちゃんのこと、かわいーく撮ってよね。ニャハッ☆", "zh": "啊，{$P$}是摄影师呢！\n要把小茜拍得可爱可爱的哦。喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
